					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "CHANNEL FX\n\nSome Video Effects like UV Offset, Mirror and Flip can be performed on the Texture2Dchannel type without converting them to Texture2Drgba types.\n\nAs you can imagine, effects like Color Offset require color channels.\nTherefore the Texture2Dchannel will be converted to Texture2Drgba before applying the effect.\n\nIn this example we are using Random and Texture from Data to generate Texture2dchanels.\nThe Mirror Quad and UV Offset effects are used while maintaining the type.\n"
					}
				},
